      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ACTION KING (1) resumed at Eagle Farm and was superb when edged out in a photo finish. The form out of that has already stacked up with 2 wins from 4 subsequent starters. Ellison's claim comes in handy, he maps for a lovely run and if he can replicate what he did fresh, he'll be hard to hold out. COUGARS (2) is a handy type on resumption, missing by 1.6L during the Wagga Cup Carnival. His fresh record is a query, though he should be prominent from the outset and he carries no weight with the claim of Quince. Can make his presence felt. HELLINDA (3) was too good from on the speed at the Sapphire Coast last start and comes back in trip today. That shouldn't be an issue, with the inside barrier a big tick to his chances. He drops a stack of weight and can put his best foot forward again. SUNRISE RIDGE (6) won't be far away.",
